Directories here can be included in a case via the --user-mods-dirs
argument to create_newcase, or via the CPL_USER_MODS XML variable.

These directories provide output support for CMIP7
cmip7_historybase:    Baseline (for longer runs) output for concentration driven
cmip7_historyhf:      High frequency output for concentration driven
cmip7_historybaseESM: Baseline (for longer runs) output for emissions driven
cmip7_historyhfESM:   High frequency output for emission driven
